<TITLE>Head Impact Protection Structure</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A "head impact protection structure" has been adopted to reduce the impact when an occupant's head, etc. strikes the pillars or roof side sections due to rebound in a collision.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The impact-absorbing garnishes with integrally molded ribs collapse, reducing the impact on the occupant's head.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
